  "raw_label": "appellant_won",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Rajesh Kumar vs The State Of Jharkhand ..... ... ... on 12 April, 2024 Author: Sanjay Kumar Dwivedi Bench: Sanjay Kumar Dwivedi In The High Court Of Jharkhand At Ranchi A.B.A. No. 1105 of 2024 Rajesh Kumar ..... ... Petitioner Versus The State of Jharkhand ..... ... Opposite Pa -------- Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Sanjay Kumar Dwivedi ------ For the Petitioner : Mr. Lalan Kumar Singh, Advocate. For the State : Mr. S.K. Verma, A.P.P. ------ 04/ 12.04.2024 Heard learned counsel appearing for the petitioner and learned A.P.P. for the State.",
    "facts": "2. The petitioner is apprehending his arrest in connection with Ramgarh P.S. Case No. 234 of 2023, for the alleged offences under Sections 420, 467, 468 and 471 of the Indian Penal Code, pending in the court of learned Chief Judicial Magistrate, Ramgarh.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel appearing for the petitioner submits that the petitioner was authorized to enter the name of the persons, who are intended to apply for the Food Safety Mitra. He submits that petitioner is nothing to do with any forged license."
  },
